[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7860.47, "timestamp": "02:11:00", "text": "我觉得我好像已经拥有某种东西了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7863.75, "timestamp": "02:11:03", "text": "关于你是谁、你是谁以及你的想法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7865.589, "timestamp": "02:11:05", "text": "你当时就是那样，诸如此类。但是就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7866.95, "timestamp": "02:11:06", "text": "跟你聊完之后，感觉你好像知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7869.35, "timestamp": "02:11:09", "text": "我想大概花了1个小时左右吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7870.79, "timestamp": "02:11:10", "text": "说到你回答这个问题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7872.47, "timestamp": "02:11:12", "text": "我觉得通过来回提问，它得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7874.229, "timestamp": "02:11:14", "text": "我想要一张更清晰的图片"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7876.47, "timestamp": "02:11:16", "text": "比如你是怎样一个人，你的想法是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7879.43, "timestamp": "02:11:19", "text": "你知道什么对你最重要，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7882.229, "timestamp": "02:11:22", "text": "就像，我想就像你认识的很多人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7884.149, "timestamp": "02:11:24", "text": "你说的是真的，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7885.51, "timestamp": "02:11:25", "text": "你喜欢吗？你愿意帮忙吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7887.35, "timestamp": "02:11:27", "text": "人们，我觉得，是的，你这样做吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7888.95, "timestamp": "02:11:28", "text": "实际上非常非常有用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7891.109, "timestamp": "02:11:31", "text": "我认识的最乐于助人的人喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7893.03, "timestamp": "02:11:33", "text": "我数不清有多少个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7895.91, "timestamp": "02:11:35", "text": "像你这样的人也帮过我很多忙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7897.99, "timestamp": "02:11:37", "text": "你知道，那些微不足道的小事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7900.55, "timestamp": "02:11:40", "text": "所以你知道，就像很简单，但你从不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7902.229, "timestamp": "02:11:42", "text": "这让我觉得自己很蠢，就像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7904.149, "timestamp": "02:11:44", "text": "好吧，没关系，你知道我们会的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7906.149, "timestamp": "02:11:46", "text": "我们会想办法的，我们会解决这个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7907.83, "timestamp": "02:11:47", "text": "这真是太好了，你知道吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7909.83, "timestamp": "02:11:49", "text": "感觉已经有那种元素了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7911.43, "timestamp": "02:11:51", "text": "就像沮丧一样，好吧，为什么不是这样呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7913.27, "timestamp": "02:11:53", "text": "正在发生，而且感觉这一切都与科技有关。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7914.709, "timestamp": "02:11:54", "text": "诸如此类的事情，你知道，就像你突然出现一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7916.39, "timestamp": "02:11:56", "text": "你帮了我，我一直……"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 7916.76, "timestamp": "02:11:56", "author": "@notSojasu", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9iC0_w5nBHNC4BhGgiYeUdW6ZfCOGIbrmqCvaFZ2PV9zycbIf4HhyAZJDeqpX-v3fXW6q93S=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "JOQ IS LITERALLY THE BEST HELPER"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7918.95, "timestamp": "02:11:58", "text": "我一直都很感激你。"}]